@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: DXP Release Notes
	Testing the DXP Release Notes portlet

Setup: 
	* I log into the support homepage as "amos.fong@liferay.com.broken" with password "test"
	* I go to the DXP Release Notes page

Scenario: Refine Highlight Search Results
	Highlights search refining should work properly

	Given I set the search filters to the "DXP 7.0" product from "Fix Pack 70" to "Fix Pack 76"
	And I refine the current search using the following refinement criteria
	| Key Highlights    | true  |
	| Important Changes | false |
	| Known Issues      | false |
	| Security          | false |
