Scenario: Sort Highlight Search Results
	Highlights search sorting should work properly

	Given I set the search filters to the "DXP 7.0" product from "Fix Pack 70" to "Fix Pack 76"
	Then the highlights for "Fix Pack 76" should be in position number "1"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 75" should be in position number "2"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 74" should be in position number "3"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 73" should be in position number "4"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 72" should be in position number "5"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 71" should be in position number "6"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 70" should be in position number "7"
	When I sort the results in ascending order
	Then the highlights for "Fix Pack 70" should be in position number "1"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 71" should be in position number "2"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 72" should be in position number "3"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 73" should be in position number "4"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 74" should be in position number "5"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 75" should be in position number "6"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 76" should be in position number "7"
	When I sort the results in descending order
	Then the highlights for "Fix Pack 76" should be in position number "1"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 75" should be in position number "2"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 74" should be in position number "3"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 73" should be in position number "4"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 72" should be in position number "5"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 71" should be in position number "6"
	And the highlights for "Fix Pack 70" should be in position number "7"

